tako demon _spec1_~
a summoned tako demon~
A demon resembling a giant octopus lies here making horrifying noises.
~
The tako demon is a powerful looking creature resembling that of a giant
octopus.  Its eight powerful tentacles end in vicious spiked claw, nearly
a foot long, and razor sharp.  The terrible beast has been summoned by
the dark priest of the kobolds... seeking powerful boons from the demon
as rewards for the hapless souls the priest offers in sacrifice.  The
creature makes an awful screeching sound, perhaps laughter, and then
attacks you with a powerful force.
~
