#1437
dark kobold priest jkyl~
Jkyl, the kobold high priest~
Jkyl, the high priest of the kobolds dark temple stands here glowering at you.
~
Jkyl is a wizened old kobold, hunched over in dark robes.  He stares at you
with a mixture of burning anger and shock.  Yet he refrains from attacking
you... he is studying you, sizing you up.  His toothless grin is pure evil.
An aura of power surrounds this old kobold; his knowledge of magical
summoning has gained through hard years of learning.  Jkyl is not about to
let some offhand adventurer destroy the temple and power he has acquired
through the years... you shiver in fear as you wonder what fate he is
pondering for you.
~
