&+MQueen Bessandra&N~
&+MQueen Bessandra&N proudly stands here, her movements graceful.
~
The Queen is a lovely sight. Her face would make any beautiful
maiden envious. Long eyelashes and ruby red lips compliment her
long lustrous blonde hair hanging down to her waist. Her royal-
blue gown covers her shapely figure, coming down to the floor and
spreading out in a wide circle. You are unable to see her feet;
thus, she gracefully skims along the ground as though she were
hovering over it. Her crown is beveled with beautiful diamonds
and emeralds-- no doubt, priceless. What ever she wants, her
husband, King Mrotha, will get-- there is no limit.
~
