Sir Gowell, eldest son of King Arden, and King Mrotha's
favorite cousin, walks among the other knights and loyal subjects
with pride. He avenged his father's death by killing King Ventor,
and his mother's dishonor by seriously wounding Sir Lamerok. He
had abandoned the quest for the Staff of Life after killing King
Ventor, being rebuked by a hermit, and wounded by Sir Golahy. He
twice challenged Sir Lagarias at Breale in order to avenge his
brothers Sir Gareth and Sir Gaheris, who were wounded in a
jousting arena by Sir Lagarias.
