Lagarias, looks upset over his present situation. He had been
wounded in a jousting arena by Sir Lagarias, and, although they
are best friends, his brother, Sir Gareth, wishes to kill Sir
Lagarias for it. Sir Gareth had served a year in the kitchen at
King Mrotha's court under Sir Kellen, who dubbed him
Beaumains. Gareth eventually revealed to Mrotha that he was
indeed the son of a King and was knighted by Mrotha himself
