it. Sir Gracian grew up in Myranthea and earned himself a spot in
King Mrotha's court. He is an expert with the sword and can
slice and dice any attempts on his person. His visor covers his
pointed ears, but one can see that his eyes are almond shaped--
an attribute of the elves of Myranthea.
