&+MXimixix, the psionic lich &+Wuses his powers to control the entire tower, and the dragon.&n
~
   Ximixix appears to be either a psionic lich of either an extremely
intelligent drow elf, or a very devious illithid.  In either case, he
has developed his powers to the ability to control, or at least influnece,
all of the forces in the tower.  Although most would want to be part of
this army, they are fanatically bound to service through Ximixix's great
influence.  In addition, he also fears for his life, which is why he has
either befriended, or controlled, a shadow dragon.  Almost everything
about Ximixix is hard to understand because he is a master of illusion,
and whether his control is genuine or illusion, the fact is that he has
organized this tower for the sole purpose of creating a stronghold for
the races of darkness, admist the lands of the races of light.
~
