dragon gold~
a &+Ygreat gold dragon&n~
&+WStaring at you with&n &+rultimate power&+W, a&n &+Ygold dragon&n &+Wstrikes!&n
~
   Stemming from the massive bulk of a gold dragon are four powerful
scaled legs with razor sharp claws that rake the ground.  A long and
spiked tail thrashes from side to side, clearing a path all around in
the destruction.  A long neck rises skyward with an armored and horned
head, that turns casually to regard the surrounding area.  A gaping
maw filled with jagged, yellowed teeth opens slowly and a long tounge
flickers in annoyance.  Large gold eyes stare downwards filled with
unchallengable destruction and chaos.
~
