#16000
logger ugly~
an ugly logger~
&+RA logger with a brutal face gets ready to kill more trees.&N
~
This man looks as mean as they come.  It is clear that he cares nothing
for the trees he kills or the animals that get in his way.  He walks as
if he isn't really used to the forest, and clearly doesn't enjoy being
here.  A scar runs down his left cheek, highlighting the single bushy
eyebrow that runs across his forehead.  Dark eyes survey the
surroundings with a deep intensity, this man is nobody to trifle with.
~
1073743884 1 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 S
PH 0 1 0 -1
20 13 35 20d35+140 3d4+2
0.9.3.0 9720
8 8 1
#16001
logger young~
a young logger~
&+WA young logger stands here, watching the animals dart by.&N
~
Youthful exuberance flows from his bright &+Bblue&N eyes.  This young man
has barely begun to shave, yet he patrols the forest searching for good
trees to cut down.  He pauses at times to watch the animals dart back
and forth and then continues on his way.  It is clear that he enjoys
the peacefulness of the forest, but is still willing to disturb it to
make his money.
~
1073743884 1 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 S
PH 0 1 0 -1
20 13 35 20d35+140 3d4+2
0.9.3.0 9720
8 8 1
#16002
logger brutal~
&+ra brutal logger&N~
&+RA brutal looking logger is here looking angry about something.&N
~
Four evenly spaced scars run down the front of this man's face, making
him look brutal and angry.  The size and spacing of the scars would
suggest he has wrestled with a wildcat of bear of some sort.  Whatever
the creature was it was certainly large, and he should feel lucky to be
