ghost lady _nofear_~
&+Wthe ghost of a Lady&N~
&+WThe ghost of an elegant lady howls in anguish.&N
~
Beautiful even in this awful state, Lady Krimeneha's ghost howls in anguish.
Centuries of being dead have wasted her spirit away so that it is now so
transparent that light passes straight through her.  Even in this ghostly form
she has dressed herself in the highest of fashion, her translucent clothing
revealing a translucent body that men would go to war for.  Whatever death
she suffered has left her soul trapped here in torment.
~
