ghost servant girl _nofear_~
&+Wa serving girl's ghost&N~
&+WThe ghost of a young servant girl searches for escape.&N
~
Her transparent body is cloaked in ghostly copies of the clothing she must have
been wearing when she died.  Even her ghostly nature can't conceal her beauty,
nor for that matter did the clothing she used to wear.  One would surmise that
Lord Krimeneha enjoyed the pleasures of the flesh as often as possible, and
that his servants gave more to the guests than just food.  She wanders the
halls and rooms searching for something to set her soul free.
~
