As comely in death as she was in life, this beautiful ghost sobs quietly as
she wanders the mansion.  Some great tragedy has occurred here, not only to
result in so many deaths, but also so many restless souls such as this one.
Like the other ghosts that float through these haunted halls, she wears
frail garments that reveal more then they cover, exposing her beautiful body
for the world to see.
