Despite a horrible death that has left his soul trapped here, Lord Krimeneha
has a handsomeness that few could deny.  His ghostly form is that of a sturdy
warrior, one used to hardship, yet accustomed to fine living.  Strong features
highlight his piercing eyes, eyes he turns on anyone he notices.  It is clear
from his features that he is concerned about something, something dire and
horrible.
