lord eckraldu~
&+LLord Eckraldu&N~
&+LAncient Lord Eckraldu wanders here, cackling with madness.&N
~
His green eyes have been tainted by madness, the madness brought on by to many
years dabbling with dark magics.  Rumor has it that he used to consort with
demons and devils in his plots to outdo his rivals.  Wrinkled and shrunken, his
power hasn't faded any, but his enemies have all been forgotten.  Despite his
success at defeating his foes, he has acquired a madness, a foul evil that
threatens to consume him.
~
