~
The demon tries its best to hide out of the way, hoping Azoum will forget
about him and allow his bonds to weaken so that he may go free.  The look on
his face is one of agony, here he is on the material plane, yet unable to
create the havoc that he truely desires.  When Azoum asks him anything he
responds promptly, hoping that quick answers will lead her to free him.  When
he is noticed by anyone else in the tower he bares his fangs and flaps his
small vestigal wings to frighten them away, there is no real fear from him
though.  It is obviously just another tactic to get freed, he hopes that enough
rumors and fear will force Azoum to send him back.  Until he is freed he has
no choice but to serve his summoner, though nobody said he had to be happy about
it.
~
