This odd frog-like creature's &+Lgray&n and &+ggreen&n mottled body blends in
well with the surrounding jungle making it easy for it to hide.  This amphibian
humanoid has huge bulbous eyes that enable it to see even in the smallest
amount of light. Though as small as a halfling, it has a ferocious look about
it that dares anything to be foolish enough to challenge it.
~
