bullywug sentinel~
&+ga &+ybullywug &+gsentinel&n~
&+yAn ugly brown and &+ggreen&N &+ybullywug sentinel stands watch.&N
~
This bullywugs brown and green skin helps it hide amongst the jungle foliage
but certainly adds nothing to its looks.  Perhaps he is handsome by the
standards of his frog-like kind, but anyone else would fine his ugly skin and
strange &+Yyellow&N bulbous eyes to be quite repulsive.  His skin glistens with
the moisture of the jungle, which is good, for this amphibian needs to stay
warm and wet.
~
