#16930
black cat huge jakar~
&+La jakar&N~
&+LA huge black cat prowls here, defending its territory.&N
~
This cat is far larger than any cat ever seen.  In fact, it is so large that
one would guess that there has had to be some sort of magic involved in its
growth.  Its eyes are an odd &+gemerald green&n with thin &+Ygolden&N flecks
that dot the area outside its dark pupils.  The way it slowly paces back and
forth watching everything around it would almost seem to indicate that this
creature is extremely intelligent.  There is a strange jewelled collar around
its neck, but it is hard to imagine anyone actually being able to tame such a
tremendous beast.  Perhaps there is something more to this creature than meets
the eye.
~
