kenku adventurer~
the kenku adventurer~
&+yA kenku adventurer wanders the forest seeking fame and fortune.&N
~
This odd looking bird-man looks extremely well-prepared for any contingency.
His oddly shaped armor has been designed to allow him the limited flight of his
kind as well as protect him from harm.  His sharp beak and closely held dagger
help threaten anything that might attempt to harm him.  The best protection
though are his mottled brown feathers which help him fade into the shadows and
hide in the event of real danger.
~
