halfling sentinel~
&+La halfling sentinel&N~
&+LA halfling sentinel keeps a close watch on the mountains&N
~
Dark grey clothing helps him blend into the shadows of the plain stone
that surrounds him.  This halfling has a grim determination about him,
showing that no matter how irrelevant this trail may be, he will defend
it with his life, insuring that nobody prevents traders from making it
to Woodseer.  He is marked with the tattos of the halfing guards,
tattoos that enable him to find any sneaky criminals that try to stalk
through the shadows unseen.
~
