resistant iron and steel into works of art.  One of the few known blacksmiths
in the land who is able to work with magical metals suck as &+madamantium&n and
&+cmithril&n, he has a several year waiting list for his products.  His skill
is such that he makes only custom weapons and armors, and then only if he likes
the customers idea.  Only the very powerful are accepted as customers for his
wares, as he does not place his finished products in the hands of those who
are not masters and cannot fully appreciate their craftsmanship.  He is rumored
to have crafted several blades which were then passed on to the &+mwizards guild&n
