&+rA teenage son stands here with his family&n
~
&n   Halfway through his teen years, this young son is already an accomplished
woodsman and tracker.  Often having to take up the duties of his father when
he must be absent or travelling, he shows the confidence of bearing such
responsibility.  His light fitting hemp jumpsuit is crafted for comfort and
utility only, and a supple longbow is slung across his back.  He sits here
with his family honing the tips of his arrows, looking forward to the next
hunt.&n
~
