of the wilds, and now has dedicated his life to protecting the remaining
families who live here.  His chest is bared, revealing wicked battle scars, and
a brutal claw mark has torn flesh from the side of his skull.  Nonetheless, he
is still in fair physical shape, and has the strength still to face his enemies
and turn them back.
