easy transition for &+bBalbus&n.  Over the years, he has developed a balance
and agility few of his kind will ever possess, and this has allowed him to
excel as a mercenary.  His jaw hangs slightly to one side from a recent battle
wound, and he wears a brace to keep it in place.  His forehead has a slight
dent in it from a hammer wound he recieved as a youth, forever removing what
slight chance there ever may have been for him to earn a living with his mind.
