materialize.  Wisps of dark fog, glowing with hatred, slowly stretch out from
him like roots looking for moist soil.  Summoned here through dark sacrafice,
he exerts his influence upon those present through will alone, manipulating
its way through the magical barriers erected to keep him contained.  A puddle
of dark blood slowly forms underneath him, small rivulets snaking their way
across the chamber.  There is a sense of power constantly gravitating toward
him, slowly growing in density about his form.
~
