#21672
king aravne~
&+Lthe &+rKing&+L of &+gAravne&n~
&+LThe &+rKing &+Lof &+gAravne&+L sits on his throne&n.
~
&n   Dressed in the royal war armor, he sits on his throne watching the man he
sacraficed slowly drain of blood on the floor of his chamber.  His eyes, once
filled with wisdom, now are clouded by hatred.  His jaw muscles clench with
anticipation, and one of his eyebrows twitches uncontrolably.  Although he has
obviously lost those qualities of his personality which made him a man, he is
known to possess considerable ability in personal combat.  It is rumored that
once a month, he summones one of the gladiator trolls to these chambers, and
kills him with his bare hands, enhanced by the magic of the prime tree.  Two
of the items which normally belong to the king are missing, however, those
being the kings sword, and the kings gloves.  It must have taken a powerful
individual indeed to steal them, or perhaps someone who can manipulate the
druidic power of the tree with greater ablility than the king.
~
