~
&+RDressed in a red robe with crimson streaks, this man's movements are flashes
&+Rof alternating dark and bright red. He is the mage of this strange house on
&+Rthe hill. Although he is not a native of Mosswood Village, he has been around
&+Rfor a very long time - longer than most can remember, even the village elders.
&+RThe wizard looks to be in his early fifties but this is obviously not his real
&+Rage, as he has been in the village over twice as long. He has no beard, which
&+Rmay seem strange for someone of his profession, and his hair is not silver but
&+Rplain brown. He looks at you somewhat condescendingly, and his eyes implore
&+Ryou to speak of your business here. Perhaps he expects you to be a messenger
&+Rfrom the village to the north, or an apprentice from one of his peers sent to
&+Rpick up a magical item or spell component. The mage does not yet speak.&N
~
