faint voice, she speaks in a whispering tone "My hus.. band and I were one of
the first captured.  I don't know how long we've been here, but I'm sure its
been months.  All the slaves here are under a spell conjured by the evil &+Cice
&+Csorceress&n.  My husband was burned by a torch up in the mines and was broken
free of the spell.  He then freed me by burning me as well.  The giants noticed
that I wasn't under the spell and dragged me off and left me for dead.  I think
my husband is still alive... I don't think they noticed him."
