&+LKing StoutDorf sits upon his throne, deep in thought.&n
~
    King StoutDorf is the master mind behind most of the UnderDark's
armies and troop movements.  He has had his dealing in almost the entire
planning of the UnderDark since the days long past before the great
wars started.  Helping fund the founding of BogenTok, and helping Lord
Khildarak back in the early years, he has seen some of the greatest
battles to ever tell about.  He has had painted on the walls all of
the most wonderous battles, especially the ones where he has slaughtered
the commanding grey elf or mountain dwarf.  He carries with him a huge
battleaxe, which he wields one handed, and a large crown sits atop his
head.  There are two royal honor bodyguards by his side, as well as his
pet basilisk which sleeps in the corner.  He seems to be very well adapted
in his throne room, and lets only the greatest of all the warriors in here.
~
