the ribs become long enough serve as legs. The lower extremities of these
creatures atrophy and rot, while the vital organs slip from the chest and
hang throbbing at the nexus of this creature's giant rib cage. The only
sane features left to these creatures is their faces, constantly twisted
in torment, and their strong arms, capable of wielding any weapon they desire.
