zarbon hideous creature ribcage~
a zarbon~
&+LA hideous creature crawls up to you on its ribcage.&N
~
This former drow warrior has suffer from a transfromation at the hands of the
matron of house Zarbonesti, changing him into a zarbon. When a drow undergoes
this transformation, his rib cage expands, ripping through his chest, until
the ribs become long enough serve as legs. The lower extremities of these
creatures atrophy and rot, while the vital organs slip from the chest and
hang throbbing at the nexus of this creature's giant rib cage. The only
sane features left to these creatures is their faces, constantly twisted
in torment, and their strong arms, capable of wielding any weapon they desire.
They slither like milipedes along the ground and often leave trails of a
glowing violet ooze behind them.
~
