&+wTikiapti&+L, of the &+rHig&+Rh Co&+Yunc&+Ri&+rl~
&+wTikiapti&+L, Advisor of the &+rHig&+Rh Co&+Yunc&+Ri&+l&+L is discussing some plans here.
~
&+LThe &+rHig&+Rh Co&+Yunc&+Ri&+rl&N meets on a weekly basis to discuss the goings on of the city.
Who to attack next, who they need to defend the city against, what their
enemies are up to, how the citizens of the city feel, along with other issues
are the &+Rco&+Yunc&+Ri&+rl's&N concern. They are highly regarded in the city, as they are
the decision makers, and they decide how things are run in &+GTikitzopl.
&+wTikiapti&N is the city's advisor. He mingles with the citizens to find out how
they feel about the way the city is being run, then he consults with the &+rHig&+Rh
&+RCo&+Yunc&+Ri&+rl&N on what should be done to improve morale and productivity. &+wTikiapti
is well liked by the inhabitants of &+GTikitzopl&N, as he is the one who tries to
make their lives better.
~
