#53201
barbarian hero~
an incapacitated barbarian hero~
A large barbarian lies here in the heap of rotten hay, starving to death.
~
   This large brown eyed barbarian was once a great barbarian hero. For many
years, he used to lead raids on orcish tribes. But once he made a mistake.
He tried to take over Shady Grove. Orcish spies knew about it long before.
Ghak, the leader of the Unlawful City, gathered his tribe, gathered friendly
drows, duergars and ogres. He even managed to gether a few githyanki
psionicists at his side. They killed all goodie raiders. Except this brave one.
He run for his life. They started chasing him. He was running through almost
whole continent. Eventually he got to his fast sloop. Got to island of Evermeet
and thought he would be safe there. He couldn't be wrong more! Evil raiders
also got a ship, sailed to Evermeet, and captured him.
   After some start-up softening (beating-up, bone-breaking, etc.) they sold
him to the slave encampement of their friendly tribe, Split Shield.
Too bad orcs from Split Shield decided he is no good as a slave. Too stubborn.
And that's how he got trapped in this cell, let to die from starvation.
~
