celarno gnome ethermancer~
&+WCelarno&n~
&+WCelarno &+Lthe &+RGnome &+wEthermancer &+Lis here channeling the elements.&n
~
   Celarno's simple purple robes, and humble oak-hewn staff disguise the
fact that she's an ethermancer of eminent power quite well.  Ever the
perfectionist, she works on her experiments -- attempting to channel the
elements to develop some sort of new spell.  To finance her studies, she
has agreed to teach new ethermancers in the Tower and help them develop
their own powers.  She will help you, as well.
~
