#55172
shaman minotaur duule~
&+WDuule&n~
&+WDuule &+Lthe &+LMino&+rtaur &+CShaman &+Lmeditates on a &+ystraw &+Lmat.&n
~
   This ancient minotaur has seen hundreds of battles and it shows.
Deep scars run across his face and arms, and one of his horns has broken
off.  He wears nothing else outside of simple brown cloth robes and a
bone necklace with shamanic charms attached to each segment.  He is
sitting on a straw mat, meditating, with a blank expression on his face.
Despite his rough appearance, one feels at peace standing in the room
with him.  Duule has taught many would-be shamans how to enhance their
powers, and he will be happy to help you enhance yours.
~
