mountain dwarf~
a &+Ymountain dwarf&n~
A&+Y mountain dwarf&n grins a wicked grin and expects imenent doom.
~
This mountain dwarf stands a little above four feet tall. He seems anxious
about something, although who could blame him. Although his campanions were
frightened to death of the doom the wingless dragon brought, he seemed to
revel in it. Perhaps he doesn't share the same goal as his fellow travelers,
maybe he harbors secret sinister thoughts and expects doom at anytime. This
dwarf wear's a medallion around his neck with a strange rune embedded into it.
The rune has a magical aura around it, although it isn't very strong. The
dwarf's eyes seem to light up whenever he glances at it, as if remembering
times long since passed. His wiskers stick straight out as if in deep thought,
as if contemplating whether or not his inheretence is worth anything, his
inheretence from his people recently just slaughtered by giant psionicists,
the beholders of such power the world has never seen. These giants destroyed
his people, destroyed the elfs, destroyed the humans, and every other life
in their former home. "If only they would've helped us, elven magic could've
saved my people." he thinks.
~
