in, but obviously suffered from. Since that moment they were children no
longer, they were forced to fend for themselves. The war was with the elves,
and they've sense held deep resentment for all that is elven. Even the elven
ship that was used to fly through the sky and out into space to land them where
they are now, which saved their very lives is held in disgust. If it weren't
for imenent death they would've never relied upon another, especially an
elf for support. She stands under six feet tall, around five foot six to be
exact, with long brown hair and a beautiful face. Some have said that she
could've had royal blood in her veins, and if it weren't for the fact that
