A perfectly triangular fish with curved corners, it watches over all
the creatures in the ocean. Six eyes, two on either side of each corner,
patrol even the darkest reaches of the dark waters. The gold edges glow
with an irridescent light, illuminating the thin white skin of the main
body. Underneath the transparent skin can be seen all the workings of
the creature, from the beating heart to the blood coursing through in
an semi-open vascular system.
