#75614
vampire eccentric lunatic old man odd pale~
&+man odd &+rvampire&n~
&+LA &+Rpale looking &+meccentric &+Lis here fiddling with his tools.&n
~
This short man is a vampire.  However, he has transformed his curse into a
blessing, allowing him to pursue his craft without interuption.  Because of
the blood spring flows through this room, he can satisfy his cravings for
blood without killing anyone.  Nonetheless, he is a dangerous foe as he is
over 600 years old. Once a gnomish smithy and mage, he is now the same except
a vampire, and will live until the end of time, perfecting his crafts, unless
he is slain. His "curse" also allows him to handle materials that no mortal
would dare to attempt to manipulate, and to tap into energies so dark and
evil that they would engulf the soul of a mortal, even an archmage or
archpriest, in the blink of an eye.  Occasionally serving Lord Ghulan,
he is mostly independent, and Lord Ghulan tolerates this as this vampire
has no ambitions to gain power, but only to gain wealth.
~
