&+gA small, vicious &+rred&+g alligator basks in the sun.&N
~
This small alligator has earned a reputation as one of the fiercest predators
in the jungle.  Its short legs are extremely powerful, able to drive it at
incredible speeds.  Fortunately, it also seems to enjoy spending time basking
in the sun.  Long red stripes run down the length of its body, distinguishing
it from its somewhat larger cousins.
~
