Huge ridges in its tough hide indicate that this gigantic creature would
indeed be extremely difficult to kill.  Powerful jaws full of razor sharp teeth
can rend even an ogre to shreds, and its powerful tail and small legs can
propel it through the water at astounding speeds.  This creature may not be the
most fearsome in the jungle, but it is certainly one of the largest and most
dangerous floating in the rivers.
~
