&+mReiwiggy&+g is here stitching some leather together.&N
~
Reiwiggy is a small bullywug, not much bigger than a halfling really, but he
is extremely stout.  His widely spaced, bulbous eyes seem never to blink as
he works on his creations.  It is quite clear that he doesn't like dealing
with any non-bullywugs, though one would suppose it couldn't hurt to ask.
His skin is a mottled brown and green like the majority of bullywugs, and his
hands have been stained purple somehow by the different treatments he uses on
his hides.
~
