#80175
teglaron dwarf ancient~
&+LTeglaron&N~
&+LAn ancient dwarf works diligently at his forge.&N
~
Scars from many battles criss-cross his face and body.  He works shirtless at
the forge, his body covered with dust and soot.  It is clear from the way he
focuses on his work that this is what he truly enjoys.  His hammer moves
tirelessly and he seems able to pump the foot bellows and pound steel at the
same time.  Teglaron has been in Moonhollow for many years, always coming to
its defense, and happily repairing and supplying weapons and armor.  Rumor has
it that he lives here for the opportunity to work with different metals and
substances, even dragon scale and other strange substances.  His age is written
in deep soot-filled wrinkles on his face, it may be true that he is only here
seeking a challenge to his great skill at the forge.
~
