   Skrentherlog has a massive serpentine body, looking like a giant snake
with wings.  Its wings are tiny though, clearly not able to support its
massive weight.  It has learned powerful magic in its many years,
certainly enough magic to be able to convince the Yuan-ti that it is in
fact a god.  Perhaps with power and age such as it now has, it may be
close to being a true god.  Heavy green scales cover its body more
effectively than any armor ever could.  It has grown large and fat in its
old age, but dragons don't live this long unless they are extremely
powerful.  Though it is clearly a dragon, something about it has been
mutated and twisted, making it more serpentine than any normal dragon, but
this change has also somehow allowed it to move more swiftly and nimbly
than anything of its massive bulk should be able to manage.
~
