&+La &+Ggithyanki&+L warrior&N~
&+LA powerful &+Ggithyanki&+L warrior stands here patiently.&N
~
Small, almost puny, beside the large yuan-ti, this gaunt warrior has a grace
and power that are impossible to deny.  His piercing black eyes calmly survey
everything he sees, but no expression of any sort comes to his face.  He wears
the magical silver armor of his kind, but it does not have the ornate designs
that a githyanki noble would possess.
~
