#80631
noble yuan yuan-ti man snake~
&+ga yuan-ti noble&N~
&+gA yuan-ti noble is coiled here.&N
~
One of the few yuan-ti true-bloods, this creature has a dark elegance and power
to its serpentine form.  Deep green scales seem almost interwoven with black
scales in wide whorls that slide their way up and down his body.  His face is
almost completely human, though it is covered with a layer of fine scales.
Many yuan-ti seemed obsessed by hatred or rage toward everything around them,
desiring blood with an intense madness.  This yuan-ti is very different, he
seems completely at peace with himself, he attacks interlopers in an oddly
peaceful manner, as if it is a simple duty, not something he really enjoys.
~
