&+rA cr&+Rys&+Wtal&+r golem protects the abandoned cave.&N
~
Though it stands motionless, its strange black eyes show that it is
certainly still alive.  Any creature that attempts to travel past it to
the north is roughly pushed aside.  The magical life and commands it
possesses, whether recent or ancient, have kept it here guarding
whatever lies in the caverns beyond.
~
