rockbiter stone~
&+La vicious rockbiter&N~
&+LA vicious rockbiter hunts for crystals to eat.&N
~
Looking much like the stones it eats, the squat, ill-tempered rockbiter
lumbers through the caverns searching for crystals and gems to eat.
Though slow moving, its body is heavily armored and able to withstand a
great deal of damage.
~
