bat durian~
&+La durian bat&N~
&+LA large durian bat searches for prey.&N
~
Massive ears flank a large skull with powerful jaws lined with sharp
teeth.  Durian bats of the underdark vary in size from small to huge,
with this one being somewhere in between.  Its vestigial eyes are almost
completely worthless, it relies entirely on echo-location to find and
attack its prey.
~
