leather worker man old~
a &+yleather-worker&n~
&+yA gnarled old man stands here, busily fashioning a piece of hide in to armor.&n
~
   A old and gnarled old man stands before you, his
toothless grin widening at your approach.  His patchy
white hair is dishevelled, and large areas of his head
are missing hair all together.  Rumored to work for
the various thieves guilds, his work is well reputed,
and keenly sought after.  It is said amoungst the
seedier circles in town, that to kill a thief and damage
his armor is a crime unto itself.
~
