frame bearing the signs of many a battle.  More than
used to dealing with the fights between the drunken
merchants and visitors to the town, this guard is also
one of those old enough to have fought off the evil
races that once plagued to land.  His service now
honored in serving as a bodyguard to the rulers of the
town.
~
