#80834
apprentice blacksmith dwarf~
an &+Lapprentice blacksmith&n~
&+LAn apprentice blacksmith stands here, taking down orders to be made.&n
~
   A fairly young dwarf keeps an eye on the shop, and
takes orders for repairs and needed items.  His stout
form already bares the toughness associated with the
race, and his short beard is only just beginning to
take on a darker color.  His eyes dart in between the
shop front, and back to the forge, where he yearns to
