A rugged and shaggy male &+Lc&+we&+Wnta&+wu&+Lr&n stands here.
~
   &+WHa&+wte&+Leu&n is the elder of this tribe of nomadic centaurs.  He started this
clan upon the death of his father, blaming it on his woodland cousins.  Hateeu
left the wilderness with four males and eight women, from which his tribe has
taken root.  Over the years, the people of his family took on new physical
characteristics in order to deal with the harsh climates of the unprotected
plains.  He has the upper torso of an elven male and the lower body of a horse
as do most centaurs, however his coat is shaggier than the sylvan centaurs.
His body, torso included is covered with a thick layer of ebon hair, which
serves two purposes.  The first is protection against cold winters, and heavy
rainfalls.  The second is to make him almost impossible to distinguish from the
night sky, helping to confuse animal predators and humanoid hunters alike.
~
