strife icess~
&+LStrife, Icess of Auril&N~
&+CStrife, the Icess of Auril, stands here emanating the frozen aura of her goddess.
~
&+LFloating high within this chamber is Strife, the great avatar
&+Lof Auril the frostmaiden. Strife has many dark titles: Icess of Auril,
&+LMother of &+LProphecy, Bringer of Calamity.  The body of this woman
&+Lis humanoid in form, but completely covered in an azure, frosty sheen.
&+LThe eyes of Strife leave trails of unmistakable dark frost within the
&+Lair as she hovers in a bed of ice wherever she goes.  Strife currently
&+Lresides in her personal chamber, newly constructed by her faithful
&+Lservants, masons, and worshipers of this mortal realm.  A flowing robe
&+Lrobe covered in glittering icicles further underscores the magical and
&+Ldazzling appearance of Strife.
~
