myrke stalker man shadows _nobutt_~
&+LMyrke the Stalker&N~
&+LA shrouded man nimbly skulks in the shadows.&N
~
   Dressed in all non-descript black clothing, the only distinguishing
mark on him is the symbol burned into the nape of his neck.  It's an
inverted dagger surrounded by flames.  His eyes dart back and forth,
trying to determine if you have seen him yet.  Those eyes tell a story,
one of shadow and stealth.  Living only by the speed of his steel, and
the sharpness of his wit, he is in a constant state of alert.

