anne~
Anne, the savior~
Anne, the savior, stands here, only in spirit.
~
   Anne seems to be the savior of the town, and saved the cloud giants once,
long ago in a mighty battle between the goods and the evils. Only a spectre
now, her body, though still very beautiful, is very visible and seems to
shimmer in the light. She has long silvery hair that just about reach the
backs of her feet, and her skin is perfectly smooth around every crevice.
She seems to be dressed battle gear and has a dark magenta orb that she
carries with her at all times. She seems to sit in the center of town
looking around and waiting for things to happen. She seems to mumble every
now and then about hating those damn evils that killed her. Across her
right arm, is the tattoo of a bright red rose, that seems to be illuminating
the area.
~
