&+yfour digits, a thumb-like one on each side of two others in the center.  The&n
&+ydigits can bend and be used like hands, but there are ridges along the sides&n
&+yof each one that lock into each other to form a hard, wide flipper that when&n
&+yused as a weapon is quite painful.&n
&+y      The &+Mg&+ml&+Me&+mt&+Mzg&+ml&+Mo&+y has three eyes, evenly spaced around the cylidrical body.&n
&+yIt has no head, just torso, legs, and tentacles. There is no visible nose or&n
&+yother breathing apertures.  Those tall enough to see above their tall bodies&n
&+ywill be able see a huge, gaping, tooth-lined maw on the top of their torsos.&n
