~
   Abandoned at birth by his parents, this hideous creature was put into
Tharnadia's social services in hopes of finding him a home.  However, due to
his physical defects, the cityfolk refused to accept him, some even wanted him
outcasted.  In a sign of rare compassion, the old lighthouse keeper took
Parcifal into his care and raised him to be his replacement.  For the past
twenty-two years, Parcifal has protected the ships and citizens of a city that
had turned its back on him.  He stands nearly four feet tall, his legs bowed
and misshapen, and one of his arms devoid of all musculature.  His hair grows
in dark tufts, offset by patches of hairless gooselike flesh.
