bags by the bed in the otherwise barren room it looks as if he's about to take off
again, on another adventure.  Hearing your approach he turns and smiles warmly,

	&+W"Greetings friend!  Are you travelling as well?  If you have
	&+Wany questions about my &+Ymap&+W, just ask!  I thought I might
	&+Wcatch a night of sleep here in the big city before I continue my
	&+Wtravels towards the rift valley.  A nice cozy bed sure is a
	&+Wnice treat every now and then for someone always on the move!
	&+WThough, I must say, all this quietness is starting to get to
	&+Wme.  Would you like to play some music along with me?  If you
	&+Wdon't have any instruments you can &+Ysearch&+W one out of my &+Ybag&+W,
	&+Wthe more the merrier!"&n
~
