&n	This beautiful centaur must still be a young maiden.  Tall and slender,
with coal black hair, soft olive toned skin, a flawless chocolate coat, and eyes
as green as the forest foliage, she sees your approach and smiles warmly.

	&+W"Good day to you stranger!  I am &+gTh&+Ge&+gr&+Ga&+W of Marigot,
	&+Wthe great city of &+gcen&+Ltaurs&+W in the land of Evermeet.  I
	&+Whave come to Tharnadia to participate in the grand spring festival.
	&+WIt doesn't begin until tomorrow evening, the night of the solstace,
	&+Wbut I am so excited!  I haven't been so far from home in quite some
	&+Wtime though, so I couldn't help but bring some of my beautiful flowers
	&+Wwith me, so that I wouldn't get homesick."&n

&+gTh&+Ge&+gr&+Ga&n blushes deeply.

	&+W"As I chatter on and on about myself, I am just so excited,
	&+Wforgive me.  You haven't blinked all this time I've been talking,
	&+Wits as if you've never seen a &+gcen&+Ltaur&+W before!"&n

&+gTh&+Ge&+gr&+Ga&n pauses and looks thoughtful.

	&+W"Perhaps you haven't... I take for granted the rich variety of people
	&+WI am use to seeing on my journeys.  I sometimes forget that some
	&+Wpeople might be new to the big city and not use to seeing others unlike
	&+Wthemselves.  If that is the case you must have many questions!  Please
	&+Wdon't hesitate to &+Yask me&+W about &+Ydruids&+W, different &+Yraces&+W,
	&+Wor anything else you would like to know!"&n
~
