menae sorcerer gnome sorceress apprentice~
&+mM&+Me&+mna&+Me&n, the apprentice sorcerer~
A thin &+Rgnome&n covered in thick blue robes sits here peering at a book.
~
&n	This &+Rgnome&n is concentrating intently on some strange symbols in a large tome in front
of her.  The symbols glow faintly as she utters some words, but she speaks too lowly for you to make
them out.  Looking up at you after a few moments she flashes you a smile and stands.

	&+W"Hello.  I am &+mM&+Me&+mna&+Me&+W.  I am from Ashrumite, but my parents sent me here
	&+Wto study magic under &+WAlanan, Tharnadia's master sorcerer.  It's a lot harder than
	&+Wit looks!  Even the simplest spell is so complex you cannot remember it without
	&+Wwriting it down and looking at it constantly to remember it between casts.  In the books
	&+WI've read the legendary sorcerers could just wave their hands and rain fire down on their
	&+Wfoes, but I guess everything is more difficult in real life.  He gave me some wands to
	&+Wpractice with.  When used they emit spheres of light that circle around and strike your
	&+Wtarget, they're a lot of fun to play.... er practice with..."&n

She grins at you mischievously.

	&+W"The spellbooks he made me buy to study from were a lot more expensive than I was
	&+Wexpecting, and I had to spend all the money my parents gave me on just them.  The
	&+Winnkeeper has been kind to me and has allowed me to stay here free of charge as
	&+Wlong as I help his wife clean the rooms during the day, but I haven't had any money
	&+Wto buy food with either.  Could you &+Ygive me a platinum&+W?  That should be plenty
	&+Wto buy some bread with to last a week or so.  I hate to beg though, so I'll give you
	&+Wone of my practice wands in return."&n
~
