The Elf Eater is a thirty-foot-tall monstrosity that stands on three enormous,
trunk-like legs. Its flesh is tannish-brown, and its midsection is a flat,
round blob of flesh with an extremely hard, domed carapace resting atop it.
The midsection is surrounded by forty tentacles, each a hundred feet long
and lined by large suckers.On Ityak-Ortheel's underside, protruding from
between its three legs, is an enormous maw. The maw is toothless and
constantly emits a slurping sound, with wet flaps of skin sucking in and out
of the darkness within. The mouth is the color of blood and can expand to a
great width or extend downward into a long snout similar to that of an
anteater. Within the mouth, hard plates of cartilage constantly grind together.
~
