~
This Imperial guard is typical of his people: short, dark tan skin, black
hair and dark eyes.  He's well-muscled from years of military training
and a look of smug superiority is evident in his appearance and mannerisms.
In the strict caste system present in the Empire, military men are held
in high regard and this individual looks more than happy to abuse his
status as he bullies the city traffic.

&+wAn&n &+cImperial&n &+wgate guard looks at you.&n
&+wAn&n &+cImperial&n &+wgate guard snears at you in contempt.&n
