This Imperial guard Captain is a severe man, his face hardened by long
years of war and strife.  His eyes are cold and dark and his light tan
skin has a weathered look to it.  He has a long, thin mustache that droops
down below his chin, and thin black eyebrows.  He supervises the gate
guards with a noticable disinterest, looking upon the peasants and merchants
as if they were far beneath him.

&+wAn&n &+cImperial&n &+WCaptain&n &+wlooks at you.&n
&+wAn&n &+cImperial&n &+WCaptain&n says 'Move along, please.'&n
