#138238
lord kawasawa~
&+LLord Ka&n&+wwasa&n&+Lwa&n~
&+LLord Ka&n&+wwasa&n&+Lwa of the R&n&+wave&n&+Ln Clan stands and watches the city.
~
Lord Kawasawa, head of Clan Raven, stands here in the second-story
conference room, idly watching the city below.  A powerfully built man,
Kawasawa has brought his clan up from almost nothing to it's present
position as one of the six most powerful politically entities in the Empire.
His head is shaved, except for a long top-knot that extends down his back,
a hint of his warrior background.  Despite his upbringing as a proper
kouhei, or sword warrior, Kawasawa used "dishonorable" methods to gain
his power, hiring and training the elite corp of Shadowwalker assassins
employed by Clan Raven.

Because of his ambition and intelligence, Kawasawa is feared by many of
the other Clan leaders.
~
