#138239
lord hanyo~
&+yLord H&n&+La&n&+yn&n&+Ly&n&+yo&n~
&+yLord H&n&+La&n&+yn&n&+Ly&n&+yo of the L&n&+Le&n&+yopa&n&+Lr&n&+yd Clan stands and watches the city.
~
Clan Leopard is reknown for its bravery and sense of duty to the Empire and
nowhere is that more apparent than in the persona of Lord Hanyo, leader
of the Leopard Clan.  This short, balding man has unintimidating and
friendly nature, almost overly polite and well-mannered, except where manners
of combat are concerned.  When the fighting begins, Lord Hanyo becomes much
like his clan's animalistic icon, combining ferocious power and incredible
quickness.

Because of a recent outburst by a minor Leopard official against the
Empress, the Leopard Clan has lost favor with the Jade Lady and her court.
Lord Hanyo, unsuited for the deviousness and underhanded nature of politics,
has been doing his best to rectify that situation.  Even those the Leopard
has served the Empire without fault for hundreds of years, one small
comment by some worthless functionary has put this Lord's clan in a difficult
situation.
~
