lord murimasi~
&+WLord M&n&+Curimas&n&+Wi&n~
&+WLord M&n&+Curimas&n&+Wi of the Snow D&n&+Crago&n&+Wn&n &+CClan&n &+Wstands and watches the city.
~
Lord Murimasi is an elderly man, approaching his late fifties.  He still
retains all the power of his youth, however, and its now coupled with the
wisdom of his age and experience.  Murimasi, like most Clan leaders, is a
hardened warrior who has fought on many battlegrounds inside and outside
the Empire's borders.

The Snow Dragon has always been the favored of the Jade Lady, the immortal
ruler of the Empire, stretching all the way back to the foundation of the
Empire itself.  The Clan is probably the most powerful of the six major
Clans and with good reason.  Snow Dragon warriors are famed for their
skills and abilities, and the battle-clerics of the Clan have won many
a battle.
~
