lord ajikira~
&+cLord&n &+CAjikira&n~
&+cLord&n &+CAjikira&n &+cof the&n &+CCrane&n &+cClan stands and watches the city.
~
Scorned by many but feared by all, Lord Ajikira is the mysterious leader
of Clan Crane.  Known to be a mystic of some power, Ajikira is as deadly
with his so-called black arts as he is with the blade.   Tall, with broad,
powerful shoulders, Ajikira is a giant amongst the people of Mitashi.

While bickering and political maneuvering between the Clans is as common
as night and day, for the most part they do not touch Lord Ajikira's
Clan Crane.  Fear of the wu-jen spellmasters of the Clan keep many
would-be upstart Clans in their place.  Even the dangerous Lord Kawasawa
of the Raven Clan stays out of Crane business.
~
