lord yumi~
&+BLord Y&n&+bu&n&+Bm&n&+bi&n~
&+BLord Y&n&+bu&n&+Bm&n&+bi&n &+Bof the T&n&+bi&n&+Bg&n&+be&n&+Br Clan stands and watches the city.
~
Lord Yumi is a relative oddity among the leaders of the Clans.  A monk of
the Order of Purity for most of his life, Yumi has just recently left
the monastery to assume the mantle of leadership for Clan Tiger.  The
Clan had been in a decline and was in danger of losing its position as one
of the six great houses until Lord Yumi took over.

A simple and unassuming young man, Lord Yumi has a quietness to him that's
both unnerving to his foes and comforting to his allies.  He's known to
be a thinker and not a fighter, although combat training is an integral
part to the Order of Purity's teachings, which strives for both mental and
physical harmony.
~
