#138243
lady kitsuro~
&+yLady Kitsuro&n~
&+yLady Kitsuro of the Rat Clan stands and watches the city.
~
Certainly looking nothing like her Clan's namesake, the beautiful Lady
Kitsuro is one of the few women leaders in the Jade Empire, except for
the Jady Lady of course.  Black hair cascades down her back, and subtle
bits of cosmetics highlight her high cheekbones and deep brown eyes.

In addition to her political power, Lady Kitsuro is also an oddity because
of her military upbringing.  Trained just as any kouhei, or sword warrior,
would be, the so-called Rat Lady (although not to her face) is quite skilled
with the sword.

Known to be calculating and devious, Lady Kitsuro keeps her foes off balance
with a mixture of feigned innocence, because she's a woman, and backstabbing
ruthlessness.
~
